      "helpCenter": "Help Center",
      "heroDescHowItWorks": "Create a room, invite friends, and watch any video together in perfect sync — no installs, no plugins, no hassle.",
      "heroDescription": "Synchronize YouTube, Twitch, and Netflix with friends. Real-time chat, P2P screen sharing, and perfect media sync.",
